# DUSKLING X3, DUSTY CRAWL (room 39): the dusty crawl, a warp pocket in the ruins (the mole's tent again) that skips the rest of the steps.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder.
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 39
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 27
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 26
hold LEFT+A 1
hold A 26
wait 2
expect room == 17
